BT /F2 16 Tf 54 723 Td (US 401\(k\) Retirement Plan Guide) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 701 Td (Plan: Meridian Instruments Inc. 401\(k\) Plan Recordkeeper: Lone Star Retirement Services Applies) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 688 Td (to: US employees of Meridian Instruments Inc. Effective: January 1, 2025 Contact:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 675 Td (benefits@meridian-instruments.example) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 650 Td (1. About the plan) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 628 Td (The Meridian 401\(k\) plan helps you save for retirement with pre-tax and Roth contributions,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 615 Td (plus a company match. The plan is administered by Lone Star Retirement Services, which holds) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 602 Td (your account, processes contribution elections and provides investment tools.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 577 Td (2. Eligibility and automatic enrollment) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 555 Td (All US employees, including part-time employees, are eligible to contribute from their date of) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 542 Td (hire. New hires are automatically enrolled at a pre-tax contribution of 4% of eligible pay 30) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 529 Td (days after their hire date unless they make a different election or opt out before then. If you) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 516 Td (opt out within 90 days of your first automatic contribution, you can request a refund of those) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 503 Td (contributions.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 478 Td (3. Company match) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 456 Td (Meridian matches 100% of the first 4% of eligible pay you contribute, plus 50% of the next 2%.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 443 Td (The maximum company match is therefore 5% of eligible pay when you contribute 6% or more.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54 422 Td (You contribute | Meridian match | Total) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 410 Td (2% | 2% | 4%) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 398 Td (4% | 4% | 8%) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 386 Td (5% | 4.5% | 9.5%) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 374 Td (6% or more | 5% | 11% or more) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 352 Td (Eligible pay includes base salary, overtime and MIP bonus. The match is calculated each pay) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 339 Td (period, and a true-up contribution is made in the first quarter of the following year if you) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 326 Td (reached the IRS contribution limit early and missed match in later pay periods.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 301 Td (4. Automatic escalation) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 279 Td (If you are contributing less than 8%, your contribution rate increases automatically by 1% on) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 266 Td (each April 1 until it reaches 8%. You can opt out of automatic escalation, or choose a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 253 Td (different increase, at any time on the Lone Star Retirement Services website.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 228 Td (5. Vesting) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 206 Td (Your own contributions and the company match are 100% vested immediately. This means all the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 193 Td (money in your account is yours, even if you leave Meridian shortly after joining.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 168 Td (6. Contribution limits) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 146 Td (For 2025 the IRS elective deferral limit is $23,500. Employees aged 50 or over can contribute) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 133 Td (an extra $7,500 catch-up contribution, and employees aged 60 to 63 can contribute a higher) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 120 Td (catch-up of $11,250. Pre-tax and Roth contributions count toward the same limit.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 95 Td (7. Roth contributions) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 73 Td (You can choose to make some or all of your contributions as Roth 401\(k\) contributions, which) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 60 Td (are made after tax and can be withdrawn tax-free in retirement if IRS conditions are met. The) Tj ET
