BT /F1 10 Tf 54 682 Td (The plan allows one loan outstanding at a time. The minimum loan is $1,000 and the maximum is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 669 Td (the lesser of 50% of your vested balance or $50,000. Loans are repaid by payroll deduction over) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 656 Td (up to five years. Hardship withdrawals are permitted for IRS-approved reasons.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 631 Td (9. Making changes) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 609 Td (You can change your contribution rate, Roth election and investments at any time on the Lone) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 596 Td (Star Retirement Services website or app. Changes take effect with the next payroll if they are) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 583 Td (made before the change cut-off in the Payroll Calendar FY2025/26 - United States. Keel shows) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 570 Td (your deductions on each pay stub but is not used to make elections.) Tj ET
